4. Truth in Lending Act ( TILA ) - 15 USC 1666 : The TILA provides protection for consumers in credit billing and credit card dispute situations. Under this law, the creditor must investigate any billing dispute raised by the consumer and provide a written investigation report to the consumer. The Truth in Lending Act ensures fair and accurate credit billing and lending practices. This section mandates that creditors must investigate any dispute raised by a consumer and respond with a proper investigation report on the matter. 

